If `self.call` is a function, `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(self.call)` is True if it's a generator.
If `self.call` is a class, `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(self.call)` is False. `dunder_call` is `self.call.__call__`. `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(dunder_call)` is True if `__call__` is a generator.

If `self.call` is wrapped, `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(self.call)` is False. `dunder_call` is `self.call.__call__`. `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(dunder_call)` is False.

